   symmetric polynomial of degree `N`. Under D-intersection-overlap with `I = I(P(U))`,
   `J = I(P(W))` (linear ideals, `reg = 1`, so every `N >= 1` is stable),
   `T_N(I,J) = h_N(sigma^2)`.
