+**C-NEW-IO-SIGNAL** -- CONJECTURE; statement *verbatim* (r2):
+"For `n >= 2`, `N >= 0`, and `0 <= t <= pi/2`, two hyperplanes at angle `t` satisfy
 `T_N = sum_{a=0}^N cos^{2a}t binom(N-a+n-2, n-2)`. At `t = pi/2, N = n`,
