smooth of complex dimension `k` (Wirtinger), and the coherent overlap is
`|<e_p,e_q>|^2 = cos^{2N} d(p,q)` with `e_p = (p.z)^N/sqrt(N!)` (D-coherent-state).

WHAT IS COMPUTED
